*      TABLE FOR DETERMINATION OF ROW OR COLUMN BINARY INPUT            RLMN0047
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0048
*              THIS TABLE IS CONSTRUCTED AS THREE LISTS, THE FIRST      RLMN0049
*         BEING THE BCI OPERATION CODES, RIGHT JUSTIFIED WITH LEADING   RLMN0050
*         BLANKS, OCCURRING IN BCI ORDER.  THE SECOND LIST, ARRANGED    RLMN0051
*         IN THE CORRESPONDING ORDER, HAS THE FORM                      RLMN0052
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0053
*              PZE ,,Y                                                  RLMN0054
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0055
*              WHERE  Y IS THE ORIGIN OF THE VARIABLE FIELD SCAN TABLE  RLMN0056
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0057
*              THE THIRD LIST, ARRANGED IN THE CORRESPONDING ORDER,     RLMN0058
*         CONTAINS A SENSE INDICATOR INSTRUCTION WHICH, WHEN EXECUTED   RLMN0059
*         INDIRECTLY, WILL CAUSE TRANSFER OF CONTROL TO *+2 IF COLUMN   RLMN0060
*         BINARY INPUT IS SPECIFIED, OR TO *+1 IF ROW BINARY INPUT      RLMN0061
*         IS SPECIFIED.                                                 RLMN0062
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0063
SIM60  EQU     *+1                 ORIGIN OF TABLE                      RLMN0064
       BCI     1,  LOAD                                                 RLMN0065
       BCI     1,SMASHT                                                 RLMN0066
SIM61  EQU     *+1                 BASE ADDRESS OF TABLE                RLMN0067
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0068
SIM62  EQU     *+1                 ORIGIN OF TABLE                      RLMN0069
       PZE     ,,I$STLD            LOAD                                 RLMN0070
       PZE     ,,I$STSMA           SMASHT                               RLMN0071
SIM63  EQU     *+1                 BASE ADDRESS OF TABLE                RLMN0072
       SPACE   2                                                        RLMN0073
SIM64  EQU     *+1                 ORIGIN OF TABLE                      RLMN0074
       RNT     100000              LOAD                                 RLMN0075
       RNT     100000              SMASHT                               RLMN0076
SIM65  EQU     *+1                 BASE ADDRESS OF TABLE                RLMN0077
